          "name": "Command Vehicle",
          "ref": "v3 page 149",
          "text": "Adds a morale bonus of +1 to itself and to any other friendly vehicle within 12\" (not cumulative with morale bonus, and other command vehicles). In addition, when it activates, it can use one 'You men, snap to action!' extra dice on any one friendly vehicle within 12\", except for other command vehicles. Command vehicles count as platoon commanders for the purpose of receiving orders from other officers."
